/T (This booklet is designed for children and parents to think creatively and foster discussion through artistic practice and creation. Inside these pages will feature exercises, discussion questions, and many more activities to inspire art-making. We will go through a series of what it means to be curator, an artist, and an artwork. We hope you'll interact creatively with this booklet by drawing in it, tearing it up, and experimenting with ideas in it. We can't wait to see what ideas you have in store!)
